---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Appointment policy"
  description="Read Hobsonville Ultrasound’s appointment policy covering cancellations, late arrival, support people, payment and repeat scans."
>
  <PageIntro
    title="Appointment policy"
    eyebrow="Planning your visit"
    description="Please read these details before your appointment so we can make the best use of your booked time."
  />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container reading prose">
      <h2>Cancellations and rescheduling</h2>
      <p>
        Please give at least 24 hours’ notice if you need to cancel or
        reschedule. Call reception, leave a voicemail, or reply to your
        confirmation text.
      </p>
      <p>
        Late cancellations or missed appointments may incur a $50 fee.
        Emergencies are considered individually.
      </p>
      <h2>Arriving late</h2>
      <p>
        If you arrive 10 minutes or more after your appointment time, we may
        need to reschedule. Where possible we may proceed with a shorter
        session, depending on the examination and available time.
      </p>
      <h2>Support people and children</h2>
      <p>
        One adult support person may attend. Please avoid bringing children
        where possible. If unavoidable, a maximum of one child may attend and
        must be supervised by another responsible adult.
      </p>
      <h2>Payment</h2>
      <p>
        Payment is due at the appointment. Outstanding charges must be settled
        before further appointments. Please contact reception with any pricing
        or eligibility questions before attending.
      </p>
      <h2>Repeat scans</h2>
      <p>
        A repeat scan may sometimes be needed and does not necessarily mean
        there is a problem. Repeat appointments depend on availability and the
        clinical time window. Additional charges may apply.
      </p>
      <h2>Questions or changes?</h2>
      <p>
        <a href="tel:+6498693328" data-event="phone_click">
          Call 09 869 3328
        </a>{' '}
        for help with your appointment.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
